    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Waiting on you (what to do)",
      "description": "Oldest first. The how to answer column is the exact command to run (Q7). The Open link on each row already points at the right place - a card's Trace page, an epic's PR, or a PR's GitHub page - so `item` itself carries no link (M3: a one-size TRACE_LINK on `item` would send epic and PR rows to a card that does not exist).",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "ops-pg"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "ops-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
